        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. An arbitrator shall not have the power to add to, subtract from, modify, or alter the terms of this collective bargaining Contract.",
            "block_bbox": [
                53,
                116,
                484,
                153
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    53.0,
                    116.0
                ],
                [
                    484.0,
                    116.0
                ],
                [
                    484.0,
                    153.0
                ],
                [
                    53.0,
                    153.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. He shall have no power to rule on the substantive reasons of the Board not to reemploy an annual contract teacher, placement of an annual contract teacher on a fourth year of annual contract or the decision not to continue any teacher in any extracurricular activity, provided that said reason does not amount to a violation, misinterpretation, or misapplication of this Contract. The arbitrator, however, shall have the power to rule on the procedural violations of the above.",
            "block_bbox": [
                53,
                152,
                486,
                296
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    53.0,
                    152.0
                ],
                [
                    486.0,
                    152.0
                ],
                [
                    486.0,
                    296.0
                ],
                [
                    53.0,
                    296.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. He shall have no power to rule on an alleged violation, misinterpretation, or misapplication of School Board Policy provided said violation, misinterpretation, or misapplication was not also a violation, misinterpretation or misapplication of this Contract.",
