        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. The Superintendent, or his designee, and the Association president, or his designee, will meet at mutually agreeable times to discuss issues which, through these discussions, could lead to improvement in the school system.",
            "block_bbox": [
                55,
                624,
