        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. The Association faculty representative shall be entitled to hold Association meetings before, during, and after the teacher duty day; except during student contact time or during a period of assigned duty. The total of such meetings shall not exceed one (1) hour per month during the teacher duty day.",
